00:02:40.413 --> 00:02:42.814
THE PAST COUPLE YEARS.

00:02:42.825 --> 00:02:44.946
I THINK SOME OF THAT IS

00:02:44.957 --> 00:02:46.258
DEMONTHLIOGRAPHY.
WE WILL HAVE TO CONTINUE TO WORK

00:02:46.269 --> 00:02:48.765
WE WILL HAVE TO CONTINUE TO WORK

